        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luca Prodan, Glenn Gregory, Andrea Prodan, Martyn Ware, Ian Craig Marsh\n- Groups: Heaven 17, the Human League\n- Roles: musician, singer, songwriter, multi-instrumentalist, film actor, composer, keyboardist, vocalist\n\nFacts:\n- Luca Prodan was born on 17 May 1953 and died on 22 December 1987.\n- Luca Prodan was an Italian-Scottish musician and singer.\n- Glenn Gregory was born on 16 May 1958.\n- Glenn Gregory is an English singer, songwriter, and multi-instrumentalist whose music career spans more than 30 years.\n- Andrea Prodan was born on 16 November 1961.\n- Andrea Prodan is a Scottish-Italian film actor, composer, and musician.\n- Andrea Prodan is the younger brother of Luca Prodan, who was an Argentine rock star.\n- Heaven 17 was a trio for most of its career.\n- Heaven 17 consisted of Martyn Ware on keyboards, Ian Craig Marsh on keyboards, and Glenn Gregory on vocals.\n- Martyn Ware and Ian Craig Marsh were previously members of the Human League.",
